B2Open Systems layer
=================================================================

This layer provides recipes and customizations used during company 
training. There may be intentional problems and bugs used as examples.

** DO NOT USE IN A PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT! **

This layer depends on:

URI: git://git.openembedded.org/openembedded-core
branch: master
revision: HEAD

---

## Hardware used in Training
 - Module Toradex Colibri iMX8DX/iMX8QDX
 - BaseBoard Toradex ASTER

> There may be specific customizations/modifications for the Toradex Colibri iMX8X module; again, this layer is only used for B2Open Systems training and may cause errors on other hardware outside of the training environment.


---

